  "content": "If it is malware, it's anyone's guess which. TA4922 might use a remote access Trojan (RAT), like ValleyRAT or Atlas RAT, to access targeted systems, or legitimate remote monitoring and management (RMM) software, like AnyDesk . In the latter case, it'll use a loader called RomulusLoader to bring the RMM onto the host system. But it also uses a loader called SilentRunLoader, and SilentRunLoader itself doubles as a Google Chrome stealer.",
